{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8fce0163345edcdf6f8b16f5b4d0fa30643a2e02fb16a7cc2e0e8b222c98e2ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8caa59c2a4954a85126fda7b0a7dcc7ae5dda030466fe58b8c7a4ce6e3fca2",
      "text": "茶道与偶像之道",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea2e95d911e10e9b4dad9da5e41eae49da4abb566a9b2e5e3a5f2a9655fc7cb",
      "text": "九郎因通过偶像活动推广茶道这一想法无法得到兄长的理解而苦恼。在此期间，九郎邀请制作人前往户外茶会，在共同品味的同时传达茶道之美。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8caa59c2a4954a85126fda7b0a7dcc7ae5dda030466fe58b8c7a4ce6e3fca2",
      "text": "茶道与偶像之道",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d82547e5faabb3eafec4f1998b021fdebe135d6e920b56c86dca78f65f973a5",
      "text": "近期祖父认识的人好像要办派对。\n祖父传话说让九郎你也参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102c75395903e3da8e251fd7898a73c23d17cf8df8d82da5344f634e3dd9f6b3",
      "text": "我知道了。不过根据日程安排\n可能会有偶像工作，那样的话就无法参加了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2ccf22686d56b6e02c505f91c133c29b5d819a17e5c5cb96afe18baff81841",
      "text": "回复你自己去跟祖父说吧。那么，告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83d309390fab3f49f8c588fb5d211399fe24feeb61411edb0fe61ffead99651f",
      "text": "……走了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cb62ecc0c675da52d4a69219e0d60eaa5fb1b53e98b0b4d740e871db20652eb",
      "text": "哈啊……虽然我并不指望兄长\n能站在我这一边……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2996382d1011e5e365090dd723b6263819f184f242a38a5cdefd5bad61924784",
      "text": "但即便如此，如果他哪怕能稍微理解一下我的想法，\n我也会很高兴呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f981ba29d1b58ebc9b12b1b6dc23b547676c89ac532979e0d0da3d0ea346a6f",
      "text": "成为偶像、普及茶道，\n我的这一选择并没有错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a6872e7c449f57e9f92755d4796ad6fc71848694da44f376bce1436f6ea82d",
      "text": "因为成为了我的粉丝，\n而对茶道产生兴趣的人也有很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5202a660caa7b0fab4bbe635113457e8e27b884d67dee4f813e25772708086ed",
      "text": "通过清澄九郎这名偶像，\n茶道确实正在被推广出去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f408d759a3e60ac55dce0833976fd3521a9f2c1a43a123a082641cdd939fff4",
      "text": "这正是我自己决定的道路。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d8ff5d33649e849ee6d86b42ec0f6b7343a48a8deb6e289b29355b4216b830",
      "text": "无论别人说什么，我都会用我自己的方式\n去弘扬茶道！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1632a85bf6251f350f8facb6ec182ae07f0339c14d933fd199fbf2237bcc2682",
      "text": "您好，制作人。\n感谢您百忙之中抽出时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a0e5efd03970ec60e2d33402b4f973366053860a2abbc5fea4f3f8a1585d41",
      "text": "哪里，非常感谢您的邀请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3175a8dcc949a1d6630ad929cb601137c1a748962bab9eb63c0acec7daff22e6",
      "text": "事务所附近有河滩真是太好了呢。\n这里非常适合举办户外茶会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75445bde3fcb38f09a07a4abef86b8f8532ec9987a54da1e5ca841f1c31f0792",
      "text": "（虽然今天早上发生了那种事……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55829e40740467242fb6126de1ed0888bf6e361832856f5fc8ac898e53d9a27f",
      "text": "（但现在，我希望制作人\n能够好好享受茶道）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:780cd1fc4062b487e59a1e745d5ec730d10ef48804502195f183c1d977b03ec5",
      "text": "已经铺好野餐垫了，\n请坐到这边来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ba34c58a80025418003d880ea578400dc5acc0cc8a0bd77c0bc610a0395cc7",
      "text": "谢谢您，九郎先生。\n那我就不客气了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54ef1de5b29e8ac6a0fbf83c54c28f9e7b4d881113c00d436d66350c8b7e738a",
      "text": "您或许已经有所了解，\n户外茶会是指在室外享受茶道的形式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6780b250cb6dd0d394ce70e08063677e592de8864661b94f3c7f4e051006e283",
      "text": "室内所看重的那些细致规矩，\n在这里大多都会被简化。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e9ed4fe3be040ff32a852404f86ee08ca323006194c1c5f5336de23ccbc39ba",
      "text": "所以，制作人也请放轻松，\n好好品尝茶汤与茶点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0174cb7adb8fb93ac555204a768a835fa12ff81fcf230d752afd76a4011333b4",
      "text": "（点茶的九郎先生看起来真是有模有样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c69993732edfb593d7bff919f05ff9d707487230ec0b5ff58a019074a8ac1ee",
      "text": "（……果然，在点茶的时候，\n紊乱的心绪就会平静下来呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72d93020e411e006b2d0ac38bc7a599cbe18c571dc3ae924ef1f58f8ca9979a5",
      "text": "（今天从一见面开始就感觉他好像有心事，\n不过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e012b162ea860d5081c74755ecae18d0c7e18b5bf00114fca587c9629bf2dc3b",
      "text": "（一开始点茶就恢复常态了呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32e90684f0ba2fb44074c7ccc30c20352fe2dc4cbb5516c304a76437ddf0e696",
      "text": "（对九郎先生来说，茶道真的是密不可分的\n存在啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa4973a9ebc2842358e2088a8b19c6928cc714f9b5e26e351d257d4a5dcd2f57",
      "text": "……请用，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53833e3ec17eb32c158fec2935a2a59cf2e90248780361b9f54bedbdbe7c4c5a",
      "text": "这是我常光顾的和果子店制作的\n练切点心。请配着茶一同品尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2a874f649b1d69f5a6d25e2936af9f97935a92338a23743126f337743b832b",
      "text": "好的，我开动了！\n……非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a3517235923a5dcd0d7cdcaca37762bd506034cac8cc4a3efe87b7d4678aed4",
      "text": "呵呵，合您的口味真是再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a44f29133d703ef4390c2fe91a9f66044b3c55397cee5610523cf94e83635f9",
      "text": "想要续杯的话请尽管开口。\n我随时再为您沏上一碗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b27199b206a6995e079d79ea5627348815fcdab038a342019665443a36455cd0",
      "text": "哎呀，有水上巴士开过去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff84dc93c422aec4155ea3a9fdbaf61553653d06dc3ef4edc4383464b80ba11b",
      "text": "真的呢。\n……啊，那边还有屋形船驶过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15f9c2ddca15637d65c8cc2d175dec24cae8ff39e5e64db946900b26436cd31f",
      "text": "缓缓波动的微光，穿流渡河的屋形船。\n选择这里来办户外茶会真是选对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044c2e6bfbf8c936d9c57cd7ce66ca123be31a6c41de1b854b657c1d26424b43",
      "text": "像这样一边眺望外面的景色一边享用茶水，\n真是一件美妙的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78feb1e0276348334a27d523bd5b1212608d765b3d0cab76cde2976f0d5e129e",
      "text": "感觉如何呢，制作人。\n有体会到户外茶会的美妙之处吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cacee844bdd59a897baa9d6c4972186db4628258ae27a21dc155c0d7d942261",
      "text": "是的。\n茶与茶点都很美味，风景也很棒……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0f01e7b0ad378c0d697995398d0992db66b452fd02dc455dd9c3fd3b4a45e87",
      "text": "能和九郎先生像这样度过一段时光，\n我感到非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eed67e54770e7531454b14543d7f8eb171870c0535ac219abeca2ce86c953eb",
      "text": "能让您享受这喝茶的时光，\n我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0cefab0fca9471e7ba23aa5a795d3a6bdd1c54a6b5cde2958f1834611b87fae",
      "text": "虽然作为邀请者说这种话有些不妥，\n但这次户外茶会对我也起到了很好的转换心情的作用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e84b1102f3ace3c9e505291c9ed8e5320a8803229aa5815f205b63cfb459d988",
      "text": "谢谢您，制作人。\n能邀请您来真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e9135c2860f9e5a1e16a89c45625d07b30c5368e7e217391f9aff0e87c28cc",
      "text": "今天承蒙您的陪伴，\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07a7efe611661ce1b64fcf8ffa5505f2be734d420348d87533258902d52b0efe",
      "text": "制作人所感受到的这一切，今后哪怕\n一点一点也好，我都想将它们传播给更多人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edafd810bfba0a152d2267f6d6a6200b7af5047a8ab2af03e21f6582ca8cf92",
      "text": "像这次一样轻松随性地享受也好，重视礼节规矩\n平静心境也罢，全都是茶道的魅力所在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48ffc31de676bfff464f2c679a81986390ee094c93931bca5ae377c46761585",
      "text": "为了能让大家更广泛地领略到茶道的乐趣，\n今后我也会作为偶像继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a67f76e9e8a04dab9330e7342ab1b587e490ca53df89b16ccb09ebd9741f0e",
      "text": "……真是的，一不小心就说得太激动了呢。\n多少有些难为情起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8a9ee6cb66c9957b0e37dc4ad67cf4430d7f109495c4e298540c72f3dac83f",
      "text": "不，我觉得这是一个非常棒的梦想。\n我也会全力支持您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f86a4bb3491f6cfee4b4d9fcddcc5d0abd43acc332aa32788c63b9cb6dc7391",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e3e72b9108e1d82dec5c543c83a0752b443baa6e168f448207949b42ec2be90",
      "text": "……聊着聊着有些口渴了。\n制作人，要不要再来一碗呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bff9a7b30290ff469afa6b5788c1d1ebf746299e737151ae96ea39806c382db",
      "text": "好的，请务必帮我再来一碗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_019kur_01_1_2_019_01:1_2_019_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b8956d66e77eec75323db23ec710a03ba289512f74812ca63ea98927fb7a18b",
      "text": "那么，我定当用心为您点茶。\n让我们再多享受片刻这段时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
